WEBVTT

00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:14,450
If I choose to do a vitamin C IVs, what milligram do I start with?

00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:19,690
So, you'll want to take the advice of the IV setter,

00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:22,770
but they're going to push you to do high dose.

00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,130
I don't think it's ever good to start there.

00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:29,450
So, if you could start with 20 grams,

00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:35,570
it depends on, so they buy the packs in certain milligrams sets.

00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:38,010
So, it might be a 20,000 milligram,

00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:40,410
then they'll go to 40, they'll go to 60,

00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:45,410
then they'll go to 80, or it's 25 to 50 to 75.

00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:49,050
So, it depends on how they have their sets.

00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:53,690
So, I can't say do 15,000 or 15 grams

00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:57,130
if they don't buy bags of 15 grams,

00:00:57,130 --> 00:00:58,810
the lowest they have is 25 grams.

00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:02,370
Certainly do not start more than 25 grams

00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:06,170
that you work up to 50 to 75 grams.

00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:08,170
Partly, it depends on your weight.

00:01:08,170 --> 00:01:13,090
So, if you're 140 pounds,

00:01:13,090 --> 00:01:16,650
maybe the most you're going to do is 50 grams.

00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:20,530
If you're 240 pounds, maybe you'll go up to 75 grams.

00:01:20,530 --> 00:01:23,290
I've had people that said they're higher than that,

00:01:23,290 --> 00:01:27,610
but I don't think there's any evidence that that's necessary.

